## Code Example

```javascript
const result = markflow.parse(source);
const html = markflow.renderHTML(result);
console.log(html);
```

## Math Support

Inline math: $E = mc^2$

Block math:
$$
\sum_{i=1}^{n} i = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}
$$

